OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of couple held in Iran meet
OL,4,Awith Ed Miliband
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the couple's family say they feel
OL,7,Fthey are edging closer to freeing them
OL,8,Fafter a first meeting with Miliband
OL,9,Fsince he became foreign secretary in
OL,10,FJuly, but they want the government to
OL,11,Fconsider legal proceedings.
OL,13,FA Foreign, Commonwealth and Development
OL,14,FOffice spokesperson said the couple's
OL,15,Fhealth and welfare was "a top
OL,16,Fpriority".
